── opensbi ──────────────────────────────────────────────
PR #838  overall: compliant
Spec: CL→GL rename clarifies the capability encoding field belongs to Zylevels1; without the rename and added NOTE, implementations could misinterpret CL as a generic field and access reserved bits when Zylevels1 is absent, violating the invariant that reserved bits must be 0 in valid capabilities.
